# Perfect Corp — YouCam Skin Analysis + Apparel VTO API
# Get your key (and free hackathon units) from the YouCam API Console:
#   https://yce.makeupar.com/api-console/
#
# When this is NOT set, the app returns a realistic simulated analysis / a flat
# garment preview so the storefront is always demoable. Set it to run live.
PERFECTCORP_API_KEY=

# Optional host overrides (default to the production S2S hosts).
# PERFECTCORP_BASE_URL=https://yce-api-01.perfectcorp.com
# PERFECTCORP_VTO_BASE_URL=https://yce-api-01.makeupar.com

# --- Apparel VTO image hosting ---
# The Apparel VTO API FETCHES images from public URLs, so both the garment and
# the user's uploaded photo must be reachable on the public internet.
#
# ON VERCEL (recommended): connect a Vercel Blob store to the project
# (Storage tab -> Create -> Blob). Vercel injects BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN
# automatically; the user photo is uploaded there and garment images are served
# from the deployment. No tunnel needed.
#
# LOCAL DEV: expose the app with a tunnel (cloudflared/ngrok) and put the HTTPS
# URL here so Perfect Corp can fetch your local images. Without it, the fashion
# store shows garment previews (mock) instead of real try-ons.
# PUBLIC_BASE_URL=https://your-tunnel.trycloudflare.com

# Set automatically by Vercel when a Blob store is connected; only needed
# locally if you want to test the Blob upload path.
# BLOB_READ_WRITE_TOKEN=
